{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜なーこ(*ﾟvﾟ*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週は雨が多くなるみたいです。\n雨の匂いってすぐにわかります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ!今目の前を猫が通りました!\n猫かわいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1時間くらい前には、初めてネズミと道端で遭遇しました。\n都会にも生き物って沢山いますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京でも友達が白眉神をみたそうです。\n私も見たい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おぜき、おだ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH83VJPKJY9A9X6Y6J01N22","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘いものが大好きな3人。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おぜきがレッスン前に食べてたベーグルがとっても美味しそうでした!\n先日、ベーグルを初めて食べました。\nベーグルはパサパサしたものよりももちもちした生地のが好きです。\n真ん中の味がしみてるところが好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"米粉パンとかナンの生地はもちもちしていて、味が全体的についてるので大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"炭水化物って美味しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはな ーこ❁"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH83WG7EZ23KQZACMS12MNE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツインテール"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH83XDMBFNDPD0PRBGQGQ22","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい(´˘`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}